Z||000001||jch82||01-31-2001||10:56 PM||||What exactly are the 3 original pace cars and how did they differ from all the other pace cars?<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Before you criticize someone, walk a mile in his shoes. That way, if he  gets angry, he'll be a mile way - and barefoot....||||reg||5
Z||000002||Songman||01-31-2001||11:04 PM||||That is a good question... I didn't know that there were only 3 actual Pace Cars built. If that is the case I am sure they are in museums.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
